    <Description>EF Core 10 集成：SaveChanges 拦截器（同步+异步）、按事件类型独立配置的 BeforeSave/AfterSave 分发器、RepositoryBase、最小规格模式。</Description>
    <RootNamespace>DddTactics.EFCore</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>DddTactics.EFCore</AssemblyName>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\DddTactics.Core\DddTactics.Core.csproj" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore" Version="10.0.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection" Version="10.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
